/* 上传列表页（深色主题）。历史主入口已并入录音页底部弹层，此页仍可经开发者菜单/直达访问。 */
.container {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 32rpx 32rpx calc(48rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.empty {
  margin-top: 160rpx;
  color: #6d76a0;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

.list {
  width: 100%;
}

.item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 28rpx 28rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  background: rgba(26, 32, 52, 0.7);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(90, 110, 180, 0.12);
  border-radius: 24rpx;
}

.item-main {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.item-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: 10rpx;
}

.item-id {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #aeb4d0;
  word-break: break-all;
}

.item-status {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #5b86ff;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-left: 16rpx;
}

.item-progress {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #5b86ff;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
}

.item-error {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #ff6b6b;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
}

.item-note {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #6d76a0;
}

.item-actions {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
}

.item-btn {
  margin-left: 16rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #d4d9ec;
  background: rgba(40, 46, 68, 0.9);
}

.item-btn--danger,
.item-btn--retry {
  color: #ff6b6b;
  background: rgba(60, 24, 30, 0.9);
}

/* AC#4：离线积压提示。 */
.banner {
  padding: 22rpx 26rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(60, 24, 30, 0.92), rgba(40, 18, 22, 0.92));
  color: #ff8080;
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 90, 90, 0.28);
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

/* AC#2/#7：失败记录红色标记。 */
.item--failed {
  border-color: rgba(255, 90, 90, 0.35);
}

.item-status--failed {
  color: #ff6b6b;
}

/* AC#6：长录音折叠卡片。 */
.session {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 28rpx 28rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  background: rgba(26, 32, 52, 0.7);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(90, 110, 180, 0.12);
  border-radius: 24rpx;
}

.session--failed {
  border-color: rgba(255, 90, 90, 0.35);
}

.session-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.session-main {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.session-summary {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #eef1f8;
}

.session-status {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #5b86ff;
}

.session-status--done {
  color: #2fd08a;
}

.session-status--failed {
  color: #ff6b6b;
}

.session-toggle {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #5b86ff;
}

.session-chunks {
  margin-top: 20rpx;
}

.chunk {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 20rpx 18rpx;
  margin-top: 14rpx;
  background: rgba(16, 20, 36, 0.8);
  border-radius: 16rpx;
}

.chunk-seq {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #aeb4d0;
}

/* 开发者故障注入菜单入口。 */
.dev-entry {
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  padding: 14rpx 18rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #5b86ff;
  text-align: right;
}
